            'answer' => 'Onion, garlic, chocolate, grapes, raisins, alcohol, caffeine and xylitol. Call a vet immediately if your cat eats any of these.',
            'meta_description' => 'Grapes, chocolate, onion, alcohol, caffeine and raw dough can poison a cat within hours. See every toxic food, real thresholds and what to do right now.',
