            'question' => 'Can Cats Eat Treats & Snacks?',
            'answer' => 'Yes. Commercial cat treats and plain human snacks both work, as long as they stay under about 10 percent of a cat\'s daily calories.',
            'meta_description' => 'How many cat treats are too many? The 10 percent calorie rule, plus dental chews, freeze-dried treats, and human snacks explained.',
