                ['q' => 'What are the healthiest cat treats?', 'a' => 'A single-ingredient freeze-dried meat treat from an HPP-processed brand, a VOHC-accepted dental chew, or a spoonful of plain cooked chicken are all genuinely healthy choices. What actually makes a treat healthy is a short, meat-forward ingredient list and staying within the 10 percent calorie ceiling, not a "healthy" or "natural" label on the front of the bag.'],
